<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets $75 mln four-year, step-up bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets $75 mln four-year, step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON   * 5.0 PCT   MATURITY    10.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    10.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.35    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    * FOR FIRST TWO YEARS, 8.50 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY DUE AUG 1999  NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
